1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,970
My cat just fought my landlord.

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:02,500
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,450
I have two minutes, and
I'm locked in with myself.

4
00:00:06,183 --> 00:00:07,243
She locked me in.

5
00:00:07,243 --> 00:00:08,853
Then she told me why.

6
00:00:09,053 --> 00:00:10,703
One word. Lie.

7
00:00:11,113 --> 00:00:12,073
Mister Crane lied?

8
00:00:12,073 --> 00:00:12,723
I'm shocked.

9
00:00:12,723 --> 00:00:12,883
No.

10
00:00:12,883 --> 00:00:13,413
I'm lying.

11
00:00:13,413 --> 00:00:14,573
I'm not shocked.

12
00:00:14,773 --> 00:00:16,823
She had tried his trade already.

13
00:00:16,823 --> 00:00:17,533
Last night.

14
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:18,603
My tomorrow.

15
00:00:18,903 --> 00:00:20,583
She gave herself up for Mom.

16
00:00:20,583 --> 00:00:22,213
And he kept them both.

17
00:00:22,803 --> 00:00:25,533
It's eleven fifty
nine, Miss Reyes.

18
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:27,273
Zip, get behind me.

19
00:00:27,373 --> 00:00:28,823
No. I was a bouncer.

20
00:00:29,023 --> 00:00:30,983
What is that cat doing?

21
00:00:31,183 --> 00:00:32,433
You're not on the list!

22
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:36,153
He burned so bright that
Crane covered his eyes.

23
00:00:36,353 --> 00:00:37,423
The door was open.

24
00:00:37,423 --> 00:00:39,563
And only one of us could leave.

25
00:00:39,763 --> 00:00:40,993
So I picked.

26
00:00:41,793 --> 00:00:43,143
Mara! No! Mara!

27
00:00:43,943 --> 00:00:45,413
I tried to say goodbye.

28
00:00:45,413 --> 00:00:46,863
No sound came out.
